 island winter marble story thunder candle timber helmet square steady story signal canvas copper marble orange paper purple marble table field cotton rocket steady hollow garden ribbon harbor gentle table number timber mirror table orange ribbon gentle cotton cotton shadow purple gentle corner field garden pocket maple square number lantern garden harbor yellow forest pocket rapid letter quiet shadow number bridge hollow helmet narrow simple basket lantern rocket yellow forest timber stone garden helmet winter quiet letter feather basket marble engine hollow quiet falcon saddle field circle purple meadow music winter thunder silver music forest forest ladder marble maple garden falcon orbit signal simple ladder bridge circle lantern meadow engine number table mirror planet cabin violet market narrow simple helmet garden golden cabin purple rapid timber silver window mirror hollow ribbon ladder bridge violet cabin river number river rocket feather meadow cotton steady orange shadow river number table candle maple lantern silver anchor candle river lantern river maple hollow quiet quiet copper simple hollow corner gentle steady music simple thunder corner cabin pocket silver feather window canvas stone cotton basket canvas stone marble candle river lantern table signal quiet stone pocket saddle valley stone anchor winter square quiet maple valley simple island basket river garden yellow ribbon canvas simple feather pocket feather window timber window signal island harbor thunder feather bridge purple cabin paper falcon gentle falcon square music steady island planet planet square harbor cabin harbor lantern mirror ribbon golden harbor copper cabin corner violet ladder river narrow canvas feather table window island anchor orange signal table steady shadow steady golden anchor candle falcon violet cotton garden shadow feather canvas paper meadow winter number helmet violet square orbit violet island ribbon paper bridge valley simple paper cotton anchor pocket forest cabin yellow quiet corner rapid timber circle steady purple saddle bridge meadow simple maple planet orbit signal quiet lantern winter maple ladder steady lantern purple lantern lantern pocket golden candle candle number winter engine shadow narrow canvas square river table maple ladder river engine engine silver basket letter ribbon music island rapid cabin violet letter letter timber simple story harbor circle paper valley square island engine orange quiet circle harbor corner table narrow bridge mirror pocket steady garden cabin gentle orange cabin ladder basket cabin circle winter circle rapid shadow shadow canvas rapid stone harbor rocket ladder feather market table anchor falcon number ladder music saddle island bridge meadow window yellow planet maple bridge cabin saddle cotton harbor saddle window forest copper corner valley silver ladder ladder anchor bridge river paper story stone harbor valley number steady shadow signal garden meadow gentle golden rocket rocket mirror violet signal ladder steady valley planet stone mirror garden field falcon maple thunder music stone market gentle lantern mirror thunder signal signal orange feather ladder planet violet candle pocket orange ladder forest valley helmet yellow winter engine forest valley corner cotton signal copper gentle stone river garden rocket cotton golden shadow steady market thunder helmet engine timber engine music bridge anchor simple planet falcon signal copper letter field quiet bridge silver square pocket field market square orange canvas orbit valley window signal river field river engine thunder simple maple engine circle shadow letter field table circle number basket paper golden saddle golden rocket window saddle forest garden field rapid simple island anchor corner ladder garden pocket helmet basket purple gentle stone purple feather ladder feather anchor gentle square circle gentle river river violet orange mirror market orange cabin marble story paper letter ribbon purple marble valley candle feather ladder mirror hollow candle violet field copper window window table forest purple saddle engine paper table signal canvas valley basket table shadow narrow market canvas planet bridge maple harbor mirror bridge golden forest bridge ribbon river field silver mirror timber ribbon cotton hollow orange garden corner orange saddle market basket corner canvas simple rocket silver quiet orbit orbit bridge field lantern falcon simple silver window gentle maple pocket steady meadow simple simple quiet silver island letter candle valley music winter mirror narrow ribbon letter letter number gentle ribbon window saddle garden orange gentle winter yellow shadow steady silver shadow candle ladder purple\\n\\nWrite 40 numbered paragraphs of about 80 words each, using the words above.\"}]},{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"1. The golden forest hides a simple cabin near the quiet river harbor. A violet falcon circles the steady bridge above the narrow valley. On the table, a paper letter rests by a silver mirror and a copper basket. Winter thunder shakes the timber island, while an orange rocket waits in the yellow meadow. A simple canvas window shows a gentle shadow across the garden. The rapid engine leaves a golden ribbon in orbit, dropping a stone anchor into the maple planet.\\n\\n2. A gentle copper stone sits beside the narrow garden window. Silver thunder echoes over the quiet meadow, disturbing the steady falcon. In the corner of the hollow cabin, a yellow paper canvas reveals a simple story. The purple planet holds a rapid orbit above the winter harbor. A wooden ladder leans against a sturdy timber bridge. The simple market basket carries an orange ribbon and a violet feather. A quiet signal flashes near the forest river, illuminating the golden saddle.\\n\\n3. Through the narrow mirror, the quiet forest reflects a golden maple leaf falling into the rapid river. A silver engine powers the simple rocket toward a new violet planet. The steady winter valley hides a quiet is